  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Budget Support - Green and Smart Cities SASA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The Budget Support Operation under the Green and Smart Cities SASA programme aim to promote an enabling urban environment and enhance local revenue mobilisation and inclussive urban economic development. Implementation of the budget support will contribute to monitor progress (reforms) at central and local levels. Policy dialogy will ensure necessary reforms, country ownership and commitment, sufficient resources allocation and planning.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This Budget Support will focus on the implementation of the Regional and Local Government Stengtherning Prrogramme (RLGSP) and specifically focus on the three components nammely Local Economic Development, Community participation and local governance and service delivery.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
